Subject: [PATCH 2/4] fix(npc-worker): honour the saved NPC simulator OFF flag
 on boot instead of forcing ON; add startup regression

Ported from the local tool's validated proposal npc-controls-safe-2026-09-12 (orig 2/8 -> 8/8). Behaviour change: a persisted STOP now survives worker restarts.
